✅ Step 1: Build a Local Screen Capture & OCR (Optical Character Recognition) Module
Objective:
Create a Python script that captures a selected region of your screen and extracts visible text from it—100% locally, with no internet required (after setup).
This is the foundation: before your app can “understand” what’s on screen (e.g., a quiz question), it must first read it.
